{
 "about": "SR1 (4): the reading step for search (packages/agents/src/search-reading.ts): the customer's words become the filters as structured data, and what is left is the kind asked for. Code, no model. Every reading bug found on the request set becomes a case here before its fix ('bug' says what was wrong). expect.filters is matched as a subset (keys not listed may be absent); expect.query, when given, must equal the query; expect.absent lists filter keys that must not be read.",
